stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending
    Pending --> TargetStarting: source eligible / prerequisites accepted
    Pending --> Failed: powered off / invalid target / unshared claim
    TargetStarting --> Migrating: incoming target ready
    TargetStarting --> Failed: target fails / timeout / source replaced
    Migrating --> Succeeded: source reports migrated / target adopted
    Migrating --> Failed: source or target failure / cancellation / timeout
    Succeeded --> [*]: remove temporary resources and old owner
    Failed --> [*]: clean target side; preserve safe source ownership
